{"lines": ["A live news bulletin went silent. Then a self-declared alien took over.", "Southern England, ten past five, twenty-sixth of November, nineteen seventy-seven. A distorted voice calls itself Vrillon, of the Ashtar Galactic Command.", "For five and a half minutes, it tells the world to put down its weapons.", "But the station has no idea. Hundreds of viewers ring in, and in Winchester more than fifty dial nine-nine-nine.", "Engineers find the answer. The Hannington transmitter relays a signal from the Isle of Wight, and a small, unauthorised transmitter nearby has overpowered it.", "The Independent Broadcasting Authority says it took considerable technical know-how.", "Someone put a rival transmitter close to that mast, and was never found. Was it one prankster, or a team who knew how to silence a live news bulletin?"], "words": [["A", 0.0, 0.06], ["live", 0.06, 0.32], ["news", 0.32, 0.56], ["bulletin", 0.56, 0.94], ["went", 0.94, 1.32], ["silent.", 1.32, 1.66], ["Then", 2.02, 2.1], ["a", 2.1, 2.24], ["self-declared", 2.24, 2.98], ["alien", 2.98, 3.3], ["took", 3.3, 3.74], ["over.", 3.74, 4.1], ["Southern", 4.46, 4.68], ["England,", 4.68, 5.1], ["ten", 5.38, 5.6], ["past", 5.6, 6.02], ["five,", 6.02, 6.409], ["twenty-sixth", 6.409, 7.48], ["of", 7.48, 7.52], ["November,", 7.52, 7.84], ["nineteen", 8.1, 8.412], ["seventy-seven.", 8.412, 8.88], ["A", 9.24, 9.3], ["distorted", 9.3, 9.56], ["voice", 9.56, 10.12], ["calls", 10.12, 10.58], ["itself", 10.58, 10.98], ["Vrillon,", 10.98, 11.32], ["of", 11.32, 11.88], ["the", 11.88, 12.0], ["Ashtar", 12.0, 12.56], ["Galactic", 12.56, 12.96], ["Command.", 12.96, 13.38], ["For", 13.74, 13.82], ["five", 13.82, 14.16], ["and", 14.16, 14.34], ["a", 14.34, 14.4], ["half", 14.4, 14.6], ["minutes,", 14.6, 14.86], ["it", 15.12, 15.2], ["tells", 15.2, 15.42], ["the", 15.42, 15.68], ["world", 15.68, 15.96], ["to", 15.96, 16.2], ["put", 16.2, 16.42], ["down", 16.42, 16.68], ["its", 16.68, 16.84], ["weapons.", 16.84, 17.06], ["Bu